Subject: Re: what are the differences by exchanging the order of geom and stat
Message-ID: <hr43QdrgqUQ.EqW_gUTaN0YJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <hr43QdrgqUQ.2xd13bMmbykJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <hr43QdrgqUQ.2xd13bMmbykJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
