Hi:

Fortunately, this example doesn't use any features that were
introduced after version 0.9.0 (the current version is 1.0.0). The
primary problem is that position should not be mapped. I get no errors
when plotting the following:

set.seed(123)
m <- data.frame(val =1 + floor(5*rbeta(100*20, 2, 2))/5,
                t = rep(1:20, times=100),

                id = rep(1:100, each=20))
ggplot(m) +

   geom_point(aes(x=t, y=val, color=id), position="jitter")
ggplot(m) +
   geom_point(aes(x=t, y=val),
              position=position_jitter(h=.5, w=0), alpha=0.02, size=5)

Dennis

