Subject: How to determine the best dimensions for saving figure?
Message-ID: <Q0mLH4uz0xE.jCtLyggDrkcJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/Q0mLH4uz0xE/m/jCtLyggDrkcJ>
